OL,3,GNEWSACrossCountry cancels UK services
OL,4,Aafter power cut
OL,5,
OL,6,FCustomers on social media have
OL,7,Fdescribed the situation as "stressful"
OL,8,Fand a "worst case scenario", with some
OL,9,Ftaking coaches before continuing their
OL,10,Ftrain journey with another operator.
